WEBVTT

00:19.728 --> 00:21.896
Special Operation Unit
Sergeant Kim Cheon-gyu

00:21.980 --> 00:23.940
has passed away from the explosion.

00:24.607 --> 00:28.486
The lead investigator, Min Gang-yong of
the Major Crimes Investigation Division,

00:28.570 --> 00:32.115
was also severely injured and has been
transferred to a nearby hospital.

00:35.035 --> 00:36.995
12 CASUALTIES IN GANGNAM HOTEL EXPLOSION

01:01.561 --> 01:04.522
-Did you check the patient's vitals?
-I'm on my way.

01:08.318 --> 01:09.611
LEE WOO-JEONG
WOO-JIN

01:12.113 --> 01:13.239
Hello? Yes?

01:13.323 --> 01:16.117
You're on a group call.
It's Woo-jeong. Are you there?

01:16.618 --> 01:18.203
-Yes.
-I'm here, Woo-jeong.

01:18.286 --> 01:19.829
Where are you both right now?

01:19.913 --> 01:22.916
Mr. Moon brought me to a repair shop
that he knows well.

01:23.500 --> 01:25.668
We have the girl
who drugged Min-beom with us.

01:26.836 --> 01:27.837
Gun-woo, where are you?

01:29.839 --> 01:32.717
Gang-yong got hurt. I'm at the hospital.

01:33.551 --> 01:34.803
Gang-yong got hurt?

01:34.886 --> 01:36.805
-Where is he?
-How? What happened?

01:37.347 --> 01:40.183
Woo-jin, wait a minute.
Could you please hold for a moment?

01:40.683 --> 01:44.145
-Yes.
-Gun-woo, how bad is everything?

01:45.313 --> 01:46.397
Gang-yong,

01:47.941 --> 01:50.193
he's being given a CT scan right now.

01:50.276 --> 01:51.861
What condition is he in?

01:55.323 --> 01:56.533
He's unresponsive.

01:57.951 --> 02:00.537
-He's not responding.
-Shit! Fuck!

02:02.747 --> 02:05.875
Then could you please stay where you are
and let me know if anything changes?

02:05.959 --> 02:07.335
Will you do that for me?

02:08.795 --> 02:09.671
Of course.

02:09.754 --> 02:13.341
I'll head over to the repair
shop then. Woo-jin, give me the address.

02:13.925 --> 02:15.510
I'll send it right away.

02:49.502 --> 02:51.880
BLOODHOUNDS 2

03:11.733 --> 03:13.193
Stay here.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.694
Yes, of course.

03:15.987 --> 03:18.948
When your father told me
what happened, I planned to see you.

03:19.032 --> 03:19.991
I'm sorry I'm late.

03:21.242 --> 03:22.577
What is it you need?

03:22.660 --> 03:23.828
I need a specialist.

03:26.122 --> 03:27.332
Is that what you want?

03:27.415 --> 03:29.626
Yes. I need a person to be killed.

03:30.919 --> 03:32.545
This the one who drugged you?

03:34.797 --> 03:36.174
The one who ordered it.

03:41.512 --> 03:42.889
Why were you drugged?

03:43.765 --> 03:45.225
You did something?

03:55.777 --> 03:58.613
I have an employee that cleans things.

03:59.197 --> 04:01.366
I can put him on this one, but

04:02.784 --> 04:04.369
think it over carefully.

04:05.745 --> 04:07.288
If the guy deserves it.

04:07.997 --> 04:10.083
I will return the favor any time.

04:11.292 --> 04:12.252
All right.

04:13.503 --> 04:14.754
The job will get done.

04:15.755 --> 04:17.298
I'm thankful for this.

04:19.008 --> 04:22.136
-Tell us! Who ordered the job?
-Oh, shut up!

04:22.220 --> 04:24.430
Oh, fuck!

04:26.516 --> 04:28.977
I've had enough.
I'm not in any mood for your games.

04:29.060 --> 04:32.230
So tell me, who did it, huh?
Who ordered it?

04:32.897 --> 04:34.190
Get close to me, okay?

04:37.860 --> 04:39.070
Tell me.

04:39.779 --> 04:40.905
Get closer.

04:40.989 --> 04:43.533
This is stupid fucking shit.
Tell me! Who is it?

04:43.616 --> 04:45.660
No, because it's a secret.

04:48.204 --> 04:49.372
Hmm.

04:52.208 --> 04:54.585
Hey, come on. Tell me the secret.

04:56.087 --> 04:56.921
What?

04:58.381 --> 05:00.550
Oh shit! Let go of him!

05:00.633 --> 05:02.885
Oh fuck! What the hell?

05:02.969 --> 05:05.430
You're fucking crazy!

05:05.513 --> 05:06.472
Let me go.

05:06.556 --> 05:08.558
No, don't do that. No.

05:08.641 --> 05:09.517
Oh, whoa!

05:09.600 --> 05:11.561
-Fucking let go of me! Let go!
-Control yourself.

05:11.644 --> 05:13.646
Hold it together. Mr. Moon.

05:14.147 --> 05:15.481
All right.

05:19.694 --> 05:22.530
It's all right. It's okay.
Let go. I'm fine.

05:26.743 --> 05:27.577
Having a laugh?

05:27.660 --> 05:29.996
Yeah, it's so funny. It's so great.

05:30.079 --> 05:32.415
Yeah, it's funny. It's so fun.

05:32.498 --> 05:35.626
Oh, my stomach hurts.

05:35.710 --> 05:37.795
Wow, young lady.

05:37.879 --> 05:39.839
Look at you, with your pretty legs.

05:40.423 --> 05:42.008
You must be popular.

05:42.091 --> 05:44.677
But what if I break them?

05:45.178 --> 05:47.013
It won't take much to break your knees.

05:48.348 --> 05:50.641
They'll never heal
and you won't walk again.

05:52.769 --> 05:54.020
Is that what you need?

05:54.604 --> 05:56.564
Hmm?

05:58.316 --> 06:01.027
I'm ready.

06:01.110 --> 06:03.738
Please don't do that.

06:03.821 --> 06:08.576
I'm so very frightened.
You won't do that, will you?

06:08.659 --> 06:11.746
-I'm so very sorry. Please don't do that.
-So then just tell me. It's okay.

06:11.829 --> 06:16.125
Please, go ahead. Tell me, who was it?
Stop crying. Just tell me.

06:16.209 --> 06:18.169
"Just tell me."

06:21.047 --> 06:23.549
You fucking idiot!
You're a fucking asshole.

06:23.633 --> 06:25.009
-Stupid shithead.
-Fuck you!

06:25.093 --> 06:29.013
-No! Don't let her get to you!
-Let go of me! She needs a lesson!

06:29.097 --> 06:31.224
Fucking hell!

06:32.558 --> 06:34.560
You're asking to get hurt.

06:36.020 --> 06:37.313
You want to be punished?

06:37.397 --> 06:38.648
Mm.

06:39.649 --> 06:41.234
I like it very hard.

06:41.776 --> 06:43.361
How will you punish me?

06:44.946 --> 06:49.117
Fuck.

06:51.369 --> 06:52.412
Hit me.

06:52.912 --> 06:56.332
Do it. Go on, do it.

07:07.009 --> 07:09.303
The guy said if I open up here

07:10.179 --> 07:12.140
and say who paid for it,

07:12.640 --> 07:14.725
then he will cut off my feet,

07:15.601 --> 07:18.396
and sell me to be trafficked
in Southeast Asia.

07:21.149 --> 07:23.484
You would keep your mouth shut too.

07:35.788 --> 07:38.082
LEE WOO-JEONG

07:40.626 --> 07:42.295
Woo-jeong. I'm here.

07:52.597 --> 07:53.931
Are there any updates on the girl?

07:54.015 --> 07:57.143
We threatened her,
but she's not saying anything to us.

07:57.643 --> 08:01.230
She's a very tough one.
She almost bit Mr. Moon's ear off.

08:01.314 --> 08:03.149
Did Mr. Moon do anything to her?

08:03.232 --> 08:06.903
Not at all. No one hurt her.
No one touched her. We made threats.

08:08.654 --> 08:12.867
So, is she the one who contacted Mr. Min
and gave him the info of the hotel?

08:12.950 --> 08:13.951
Is that what happened?

08:14.035 --> 08:16.746
No. Tae-yeong hacked her phone
and found it that way.

08:16.829 --> 08:17.830
Ah.

08:17.914 --> 08:22.084
Woo-jeong, could you then go inside
and maybe see her yourself?

08:23.252 --> 08:25.755
Sure. Please tell me who she is.

08:26.255 --> 08:29.091
Oh, come on. Just one cigarette.

08:30.134 --> 08:32.762
You're all such fucking tight-asses!

08:32.845 --> 08:34.305
All sorts of tactics. Damn it.

08:34.388 --> 08:35.306
-Mr. Moon.
-Yes?

08:35.890 --> 08:37.934
-Hello.
-Oh, you came.

08:38.017 --> 08:41.646
Woo-jeong, welcome.
Well, I can't get through.

08:41.729 --> 08:44.690
-You might be able to reason with her.
-Sure. I will try speaking with her.

08:44.774 --> 08:45.775
Good luck.

08:56.118 --> 08:57.620
Who said you could sit?

09:05.920 --> 09:08.464
Fuck off, you disgusting ass!

09:16.806 --> 09:19.100
Will you go fuck off?!
What's wrong with you?!

09:19.183 --> 09:21.185
-Fuck this, seriously.
-Ah, don't do it!

09:24.272 --> 09:26.315
Is it okay if I sit here?

09:42.748 --> 09:46.168
Will you… work things out?

09:47.253 --> 09:49.589
I'd appreciate it
if you could cooperate with us.

09:55.595 --> 09:57.388
I can wait longer if you need.

09:59.724 --> 10:03.102
Ah, this fucking sucks!
Who brought this guy?

10:06.397 --> 10:07.315
Hey.

10:08.190 --> 10:10.109
Just go fuck yourself already.

10:10.192 --> 10:13.821
The police got info from your phone
and were able to raid the hotel.

10:15.072 --> 10:16.282
Did you know that?

10:17.950 --> 10:20.661
They probably think
you leaked the information

10:20.745 --> 10:22.705
and they're looking for you right now.

10:24.790 --> 10:26.500
You know how they'll hurt you.

10:27.209 --> 10:29.378
They won't forgive you for the breach.

10:30.004 --> 10:33.716
They'll never believe you,
no matter how much you try and explain.

10:33.799 --> 10:36.677
They'll track you down
and they'll get their revenge.

10:36.761 --> 10:41.057
So if you cooperate with us…
we can make sure you'll be safe.

10:41.140 --> 10:44.810
How can you find a way
to protect me from them?

10:45.394 --> 10:49.106
You see, if we catch them first, there'll
be no way for them to try and hurt you.

10:49.607 --> 10:52.735
That'll be how we do it.
The next step would be a reduced sentence.

10:52.818 --> 10:55.446
Are you fucking stupid
or out of your mind?

10:55.529 --> 10:58.032
Why would I go to jail?
I have nothing to confess. Got it?

10:58.115 --> 11:00.034
Gi-na? This is the deal.

11:00.910 --> 11:02.745
If you cooperate with us…

11:06.248 --> 11:08.501
we can help you
out of the situation safely.

11:10.378 --> 11:11.337
Trust me.

11:32.358 --> 11:33.442
Let me go.

11:34.026 --> 11:34.860
The tape.

11:39.824 --> 11:41.283
Sun-bo, you've got a knife?

11:41.367 --> 11:42.785
Woo-jeong, think it through.

12:00.970 --> 12:02.304
Thank you, Sun-bo.

12:10.938 --> 12:13.065
The person who hired me is Lee Man-bae.

12:13.774 --> 12:14.900
You know where he is now?

12:16.485 --> 12:18.320
Why would I know that?

12:18.821 --> 12:21.282
I only meet him when he has a job for me.

12:21.365 --> 12:22.950
How long have you known him?

12:24.243 --> 12:27.121
It's been three years
when he gave me the first job.

12:27.204 --> 12:28.622
What did you do for him then?

12:30.458 --> 12:33.836
Hey. For crying out loud,
why would I tell you?

12:33.919 --> 12:35.004
Such a bitch.

12:37.506 --> 12:40.384
Then can you say the names
of who Lee Man-bae's working with?

12:41.051 --> 12:43.929
How would I know? I've met him once.

12:44.013 --> 12:48.017
Why don't you give us some more
information about how he operates?

12:51.103 --> 12:51.979
Hey, you there.

12:58.486 --> 13:00.279
She has a lot of tactics.

13:22.134 --> 13:25.805
A while ago,
we drank so much we blacked out.

13:25.888 --> 13:30.643
That's when he told me he used to do work
for the National Intelligence Service.

13:32.144 --> 13:35.314
But he left that job
because he had some troubles with money.

13:35.815 --> 13:37.525
He couldn't find another job,

13:37.608 --> 13:41.278
so he started connecting people
with the ones from the service.

13:41.362 --> 13:43.322
He seemed honest about that.

13:43.823 --> 13:46.867
But who knows for sure?
He's not exactly the open type.

13:47.993 --> 13:49.328
You have his contact info?

13:50.996 --> 13:52.790
It changes every time he calls.

13:53.290 --> 13:55.251
He never answers when I call.

13:56.168 --> 13:59.630
So we correspond via text, and I'd wait.

14:04.134 --> 14:05.970
What was the drug
you put in Min-beom's drink?

14:06.053 --> 14:08.514
Four-eyes.

14:08.597 --> 14:09.723
Yeah?

14:09.807 --> 14:11.433
Bring my bag here.

14:38.043 --> 14:40.129
Will you help us meet with Lee Man-bae?

14:46.677 --> 14:48.512
I'd get fucked then.

14:51.265 --> 14:52.558
Gi-na.

14:53.142 --> 14:54.977
We're in the same position.

14:56.061 --> 14:58.814
You can only live if we catch them.

15:00.691 --> 15:03.277
Oh, damn this to hell.

15:10.451 --> 15:13.245
It's already so late. Tomorrow, I will.

15:16.540 --> 15:18.250
Fine. We'll bring you to the hotel.

15:18.334 --> 15:19.919
It's where we are.

15:20.419 --> 15:22.087
Your place is too dangerous.

15:36.518 --> 15:37.436
This way.

16:07.383 --> 16:09.259
-Gun-woo, you're here?
-Hello.

16:15.432 --> 16:17.643
When did you get back from the hospital?

16:18.352 --> 16:19.603
Are you okay?

16:21.438 --> 16:23.232
The doctor said I should go home.

16:29.405 --> 16:30.406
How's Gang-yong?

16:33.409 --> 16:35.077
He's still in the ER.

16:38.122 --> 16:39.540
He's still unconscious.

16:40.416 --> 16:41.667
So he's the same.

16:46.839 --> 16:50.384
How are you? Did you get hurt? You okay?

16:52.678 --> 16:53.637
You know,

16:55.472 --> 16:56.974
I've been thinking about it.

16:58.892 --> 17:00.102
I've thought it over.

17:00.602 --> 17:01.812
I can't stop thinking…

17:05.357 --> 17:06.525
that it's my fault.

17:09.945 --> 17:11.280
That all of it's my fault.

17:11.989 --> 17:13.991
No, it's not. It's not at all.

17:14.074 --> 17:15.159
I should have just--

17:15.242 --> 17:17.619
Gun-woo, listen to me, okay? Hey.

17:18.620 --> 17:20.664
Just please hear me. Gun-woo.

17:20.748 --> 17:24.168
Look at me. Okay? Hey, Kim Gun-woo.

17:28.630 --> 17:30.924
Min-beom, Gang-yong, and Mr. Moon,

17:31.884 --> 17:34.428
they were the ones who wanted to join us.

17:35.012 --> 17:38.599
No matter what, they would have fought
with us anyway. You know that.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.643
We couldn't have stopped them
from joining us,

17:41.727 --> 17:44.021
and I understand why they've chosen to.

17:44.605 --> 17:46.190
They've got to fight with us.

17:46.690 --> 17:47.566
Why?

17:49.068 --> 17:50.402
Because you did.

17:51.945 --> 17:54.740
You risked your life
to fight for all of us.

17:55.699 --> 17:59.244
We're connected because of you, Gun-woo.

17:59.328 --> 18:00.746
You know that, right?

18:02.164 --> 18:04.333
If you're gone from our lives,

18:05.209 --> 18:06.168
it's like…

18:08.295 --> 18:09.922
It's just not possible.

18:11.673 --> 18:14.718
So if you're in danger or in trouble,

18:15.302 --> 18:17.638
we all have to make sure to protect you.

18:18.347 --> 18:20.599
Look at Gang-yong and Mr. Moon
for example.

18:20.682 --> 18:22.142
A loan shark and a cop?

18:22.643 --> 18:25.062
They don't really fit together,
and yet, it's working out.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.855
Do you know why that is? Huh?

18:27.523 --> 18:28.565
Gun-woo,

18:29.817 --> 18:31.819
it's because of you…

18:34.238 --> 18:35.823
that we're a family.

18:37.157 --> 18:39.201
You're not the one causing problems.

18:40.327 --> 18:42.079
You're keeping us alive.

18:42.579 --> 18:45.415
It's all because of you that I'm here.

18:52.214 --> 18:54.591
So, Gun-woo--

18:55.968 --> 18:57.761
You know our rule, right?

18:59.555 --> 19:00.639
Once a family…

19:04.184 --> 19:05.894
A… always family.

19:05.978 --> 19:07.396
And family?

19:10.399 --> 19:11.650
Keep each other

19:12.151 --> 19:15.654
s, s, safe…

19:15.737 --> 19:17.656
…until we die.

19:18.657 --> 19:23.036
Min-beom and Gang-yong will wake up soon.
They're really tough folks, you know.

19:25.122 --> 19:26.081
So then,

19:27.374 --> 19:29.918
you need to keep it together for them.

19:31.378 --> 19:32.462
Understand?

19:40.179 --> 19:41.388
Mm-hmm.

19:48.729 --> 19:49.855
Feeling hungry?

19:52.816 --> 19:55.861
Woo-jeong, are you hungry?
Let's order some room service.

19:55.944 --> 19:57.613
Does a bunch of dishes, sound good?

19:58.280 --> 19:59.573
Yeah, sounds great.

20:10.083 --> 20:11.335
What should we order?

20:13.295 --> 20:14.421
Woo-jin's right.

20:16.048 --> 20:17.174
I'll protect.

20:18.508 --> 20:20.969
I have to protect my family
with my own hands.

20:27.100 --> 20:29.228
Hold on. This guy.

20:32.314 --> 20:36.401
He's got a crazy long reach.
He'll do well against Gun-woo. Next.

20:37.152 --> 20:38.362
Scroll down.

20:39.696 --> 20:40.989
That one.

20:43.075 --> 20:46.161
I want this fucker. He's a dirty fighter.

20:46.662 --> 20:48.538
The exact opposite of Gun-woo.

20:50.415 --> 20:52.793
Good shit. This'll be fun.

20:58.048 --> 21:00.050
Hi, Tae-yeong. What is it?

21:01.260 --> 21:02.678
You've got to see this.

21:03.178 --> 21:06.640
It says this Thursday at 11 p.m.,
Gun-woo's going to fight.

21:07.891 --> 21:09.017
When did you see this?

21:09.518 --> 21:11.520
It was put up just right now.

21:13.480 --> 21:14.439
Where's Gun-woo?

21:14.940 --> 21:18.318
-He must have gone to exercise.
-They won't stop trying to get Gun-woo.

21:41.925 --> 21:45.637
You have a linear fracture.
It's in the frontal bone area.

21:45.721 --> 21:46.847
Can you see it?

21:47.431 --> 21:48.473
Frontal bone?

21:49.891 --> 21:51.727
This is a hairline fracture.

21:52.227 --> 21:54.813
The hematoma
is causing intracranial pressure.

21:54.896 --> 21:58.817
Until the pressure stops and returns
to normal, you need to get plenty of rest.

21:58.900 --> 22:00.277
I get it. Thank you.

22:00.360 --> 22:01.528
Wait, hold on.

22:02.404 --> 22:04.031
There can be complications.

22:05.282 --> 22:07.242
I realize the complications.
Thanks for your time.

22:07.326 --> 22:09.244
We need to monitor it regularly.

22:09.328 --> 22:11.121
Thanks again. Have a good day.

22:11.204 --> 22:13.540
If the pressure increases,
you'll need surgery!

22:24.926 --> 22:27.346
-There hasn't been a response yet?
-Nope.

22:28.805 --> 22:32.726
Does Lee Man-bae normally
take a while to respond to you?

22:33.310 --> 22:35.270
It always changes.

22:38.815 --> 22:39.900
I want an iced coffee.

22:54.748 --> 22:57.751
-Did you work out?
-Yeah, I went downstairs.

22:57.834 --> 22:59.378
I could have gone with you.

22:59.961 --> 23:02.714
You were sleeping deeply,
so I went by myself.

23:03.215 --> 23:04.299
Then tomorrow,

23:05.801 --> 23:07.135
we'll exercise together.

23:09.596 --> 23:10.514
Mm.

23:15.310 --> 23:17.187
GANG-YONG

23:20.565 --> 23:21.566
Hello?

23:22.067 --> 23:24.277
It's Gang-yong. Our champ, where are you?

23:29.366 --> 23:30.992
You okay?

23:31.743 --> 23:33.703
We've been all staying here at the hotel.

23:40.502 --> 23:41.503
-Hey.
-Hello.

23:43.213 --> 23:44.089
This way.

23:46.133 --> 23:47.342
Please, over here.

23:54.141 --> 23:55.142
Mr. Min!

23:55.976 --> 23:56.810
Hi there. All right.

23:56.893 --> 23:59.354
Mr. Min, you're fine?
You must be if you're out.

23:59.438 --> 24:01.898
-I've got to keep it easy.
-Okay, good.

24:03.608 --> 24:04.818
Don't worry.

24:18.165 --> 24:19.082
Let's talk.

24:19.583 --> 24:20.417
Yes.

24:30.135 --> 24:31.887
Who could have told them
we were on our way?

24:35.182 --> 24:36.766
I thought about every detective

24:36.850 --> 24:40.228
and Special Operation Unit officers
who were at the scene.

24:41.104 --> 24:43.356
I can't figure any of it out.

24:43.440 --> 24:47.110
The dead are the only ones
who aren't suspects right now.

24:47.819 --> 24:52.240
Maybe it was one of the hotel workers
I talked to.

24:52.324 --> 24:54.576
Someone at the front desk when I called.

24:55.994 --> 24:58.413
Then someone could have overheard
and leaked it.

24:59.539 --> 25:03.293
Is this… what we need
to be focused on right now?

25:03.376 --> 25:07.005
Mr. Min, it would be logical
to look at Lee Man-bae now.

25:09.966 --> 25:11.134
We should move on our own.

25:11.968 --> 25:14.679
Everyone wants to get us, so

25:16.556 --> 25:17.807
we'll split up into two.

25:17.891 --> 25:20.268
Woo-jeong and I will follow Lee Man-bae,

25:20.352 --> 25:22.229
and Woo-jin and Gwang-mu will…

25:22.312 --> 25:25.315
Oh, wait, I'm sorry.
No. Oh. No, my apologies.

25:25.398 --> 25:28.109
Ah, it's all right.
You don't have to be too formal with me.

25:28.193 --> 25:32.280
You both will handle
Yun Tae-geom's family.

25:32.364 --> 25:35.158
-We have no idea when he might show up.
-Yes.

25:35.242 --> 25:38.703
Mr. Min, we found the drug
used in President Hong's drink.

25:38.787 --> 25:40.372
We sent it to Forensic Service.

25:40.455 --> 25:43.291
Good. When will the results come out?

25:43.375 --> 25:45.585
-The day after tomorrow.
-Great.

25:45.669 --> 25:46.962
MARCH 13, 22:00
OLD BLDG. OF KOERI

25:50.298 --> 25:51.132
Gun-woo.

25:53.718 --> 25:54.844
-You okay?
-Yes?

25:55.595 --> 25:57.138
Mr. Min wants to talk to you.

25:58.223 --> 25:59.432
Yes, sir?

26:00.684 --> 26:01.768
What do you wanna do?

26:03.687 --> 26:04.813
What?

26:05.397 --> 26:08.233
Uh, sir. Gun-woo can maybe stay here?

26:08.316 --> 26:10.569
It could help
if he stays in this building.

26:11.361 --> 26:14.072
Yes. The IKFC website had a post today

26:14.155 --> 26:17.909
that said Gun-woo was going to be
having a fight there this Thursday night.

26:18.410 --> 26:21.037
They'll do anything to get him to fight.

26:22.956 --> 26:25.625
Since there's tight security,
this place will be the safest.

26:27.794 --> 26:30.630
That's right. Yeah. It's for the best.

26:30.714 --> 26:35.093
Stay here for a bit longer.
We'll catch them, no matter what.

26:36.386 --> 26:38.305
Yes. Sir.

26:39.472 --> 26:41.057
We're in this together.

26:41.141 --> 26:42.225
Yes!

26:46.021 --> 26:48.940
-Good. One, two, three.
-Let's do it!

26:50.233 --> 26:53.069
Half. Call. Call, call.

26:55.238 --> 26:56.406
Half. Call.

26:57.407 --> 26:58.325
Half. Call.

27:06.916 --> 27:08.209
MANJI: WHERE ARE YOU?

28:04.307 --> 28:05.725
Shit, fuck.

28:13.149 --> 28:16.778
TARGET IN FRONT OF SOCIETY CAFE
ELIMINATE IMMEDIATELY

29:02.907 --> 29:04.033
No! Shit!

29:05.243 --> 29:07.495
Gi-na. Gi-na! Fuck.

29:09.456 --> 29:11.833
-Look at me, Stay with us.
-Someone's been hurt!

29:12.333 --> 29:15.587
674, Seoksan-dong, Jungang-gu.
Please hurry, please!

30:33.414 --> 30:35.333
Just going for a short walk.

30:59.858 --> 31:00.775
Follow me.

31:43.943 --> 31:44.819
Sit down.

31:58.041 --> 32:02.045
It's good to see you in person.
To think we could have done this sooner,

32:03.421 --> 32:04.797
You stupid fucking asshole.

32:07.216 --> 32:09.260
I lost billions because of you.

32:12.430 --> 32:13.389
Anyway.

32:16.017 --> 32:17.477
So tell me what makes you fight.

32:22.482 --> 32:23.316
Family?

32:26.361 --> 32:27.278
Friends?

32:31.157 --> 32:32.450
Those aren't forever.

32:32.951 --> 32:34.410
They'll leave in the end.

32:35.370 --> 32:38.081
It's money that stays. It's what'll last.

32:38.873 --> 32:41.668
Only the funds in your bank
are what protect you.

32:44.379 --> 32:46.714
Money's what I fucking love.

32:48.424 --> 32:51.427
Because money stays with you,
never betrays you.

32:55.181 --> 32:57.600
Boxing was invented to make money.

32:58.601 --> 33:01.020
That's why the same weight-classed
fighters are matched,

33:01.104 --> 33:02.605
so they could last longer.

33:03.982 --> 33:06.109
Better for television, for ads.

33:06.192 --> 33:08.861
Boxers rest just enough
to stay alive for another one.

33:12.323 --> 33:15.952
These rules… were all made
to make a lot of money.

33:19.122 --> 33:20.331
So that's why

33:21.791 --> 33:23.334
you're gonna make money too.

33:24.460 --> 33:25.294
Got it?

33:31.175 --> 33:32.343
I don't want money,

33:33.469 --> 33:34.679
but let's do this.

33:43.563 --> 33:44.814
Well done.

33:46.691 --> 33:48.067
Then beat two assholes first.

33:51.988 --> 33:52.822
And…

33:55.199 --> 33:56.284
if you lose…

33:58.453 --> 34:00.204
your whole family will die.

34:34.781 --> 34:36.407
-Gun-woo!
-Gun-woo?

34:36.491 --> 34:37.408
Anything wrong?

34:37.492 --> 34:40.328
-We need to see Gun-woo.
-He just went out for a short walk.

34:40.411 --> 34:41.537
He did?

34:43.498 --> 34:44.916
GUN-WOO

34:45.708 --> 34:49.337
Phone is turned off.
You will be connected to voicemail.

34:57.845 --> 34:59.639
Wrap these on your knuckles.

35:02.266 --> 35:03.601
This is how they fight here.

35:04.852 --> 35:06.312
I'll keep fighting the way I do.

35:06.813 --> 35:09.232
You won't win without these.

35:30.378 --> 35:32.421
Ow!

35:38.219 --> 35:42.348
The IKFC debut of the WBC
super middleweight champion begins.

35:42.431 --> 35:46.394
Fighting out of Seoul, South Korea,
Kim "Scarface" Gun-woo!

35:46.477 --> 35:50.523
His opponent, with an IKFC record
of seven wins and three losses,

35:50.606 --> 35:51.941
Metal Mantis!

35:52.024 --> 35:55.987
And let's blow this shit up!

36:30.563 --> 36:31.814
Let's fight!

36:31.898 --> 36:36.235
All right, the first fight has just begun.

36:37.028 --> 36:40.573
Oh! Metal Mantis just landed
a sweet jab on his face.

36:40.656 --> 36:42.408
Look at him. He's smiling.

36:42.491 --> 36:45.119
He's literally enjoying this fight.

36:46.412 --> 36:49.081
Whoa! Now it's getting wild now, yo.

36:49.165 --> 36:52.418
They are throwing shots at each other
like there's no tomorrow.

36:52.501 --> 36:56.422
Oh, look at him. Look at champ's
head movement. That is insane.

36:56.505 --> 36:59.008
He's way too big, way too fast.

36:59.592 --> 37:01.385
Ooh!

37:04.805 --> 37:06.390
Uh-oh. What is he up to?

37:07.683 --> 37:10.728
Ooh! Jeez, his footstep
is getting faster now.

37:10.811 --> 37:13.022
It is getting faster, and faster.
What is he--

37:13.105 --> 37:14.023
Oh!

37:14.523 --> 37:20.446
Boom! Goddamn! He just knocked him out
with a fucking single shot!

37:20.529 --> 37:23.449
-He takes the win! Let's go!
-They love him. It's insane.

37:26.702 --> 37:29.497
They think Scarface…
He might be stronger than Hunter.

37:38.339 --> 37:40.466
You see "KOERI"? Look it up.

37:45.179 --> 37:47.306
Korea Ocean Engineering
Research Institute.

37:47.390 --> 37:48.891
-Send officers there.
-Yes.

37:53.020 --> 37:54.438
Let's fight!

37:56.482 --> 37:59.485
Hey. Over here. It's game time.

38:06.242 --> 38:07.285
All right.

38:27.096 --> 38:28.764
All right, try and hit me!

39:10.556 --> 39:11.432
I got you!

39:13.559 --> 39:14.894
Shit! Shit.

39:36.290 --> 39:37.750
Get down here!

39:53.974 --> 39:56.477
-Put this asshole on the Intranet.
-Will do.

40:07.655 --> 40:08.906
Let's fight!

40:25.631 --> 40:26.632
Ugh!

40:43.858 --> 40:45.693
Oh, shit. Fuck.

41:28.652 --> 41:30.029
Agh!

42:13.572 --> 42:16.534
Oh no! Poor Gun-woo!

42:34.343 --> 42:35.344
Ay!

42:42.643 --> 42:43.811
Agh!

43:20.848 --> 43:24.476
Oh shit! We've got three minutes
to get out. The cops are here!

43:25.227 --> 43:27.313
We've got to go now! The police!

43:29.857 --> 43:32.276
President Im. We gotta go.
We have to leave now!

43:32.359 --> 43:33.611
Let go, you little shithead!

43:33.694 --> 43:36.280
Listen up. The cops are here. We gotta go!

43:38.949 --> 43:41.118
-Doors are wedged!
-Bolt cutters!

43:42.036 --> 43:43.120
I have them!

43:53.589 --> 43:55.049
-I've got them.
-Run! Hurry!

43:55.633 --> 43:58.427
-Get in there!
-Go in now! Hurry!

44:03.974 --> 44:05.559
Grab them! Over there!

44:10.439 --> 44:11.982
Hurry! Go faster!

44:13.734 --> 44:15.319
We need an ambulance!

44:30.709 --> 44:31.669
Woo-jin.

44:34.254 --> 44:35.172
Gun-woo.

44:37.883 --> 44:39.843
Hey, hey, be careful. Take it easy.

44:42.346 --> 44:43.597
When did you get here?

44:46.141 --> 44:47.893
Just about an hour ago.

44:50.312 --> 44:51.313
How are you?

44:54.775 --> 44:55.693
Mm.

44:56.777 --> 44:57.945
Why'd you go there?

44:59.321 --> 45:01.115
If I didn't show up, then…

45:03.867 --> 45:05.327
they'd hurt Mom and you.

45:12.000 --> 45:13.961
It could have been much worse.

45:15.754 --> 45:16.964
I'm so sorry.

45:18.424 --> 45:20.300
Why would you be sorry?

45:22.386 --> 45:23.721
I'm very sorry.

45:25.055 --> 45:27.766
Gun-woo, I already knew you did it for us.

45:28.267 --> 45:29.727
That's who you are.

45:30.436 --> 45:32.312
You protect others.

45:35.607 --> 45:36.650
But, Gun-woo,

45:38.569 --> 45:40.237
we always need to stick together.

45:43.157 --> 45:45.576
That is what Mr. Choi told us.

45:52.499 --> 45:54.501
From now on, let's stick together.

45:55.669 --> 45:56.628
You got that?

45:58.797 --> 46:00.716
If we die, we die together.

46:01.467 --> 46:03.427
If we live, we live together.

46:05.053 --> 46:06.388
That's who we are.

46:22.613 --> 46:24.865
Im Baek-jeong was born in 1985.

46:24.948 --> 46:27.451
He won a silver medal
in the light heavyweight division

46:27.534 --> 46:28.952
at the Incheon Asian Games in 2014.

46:29.036 --> 46:31.705
He turned pro and won 17 matches in a row.

46:31.789 --> 46:35.584
He lost to the WBA
light heavyweight champion Chris Dustin.

46:35.667 --> 46:36.960
He refused to accept the decision

46:37.044 --> 46:40.422
and protested by assaulting the referee
and got physical with his coach.

46:40.506 --> 46:43.050
He ended up serving time
for assaulting the referee

46:43.133 --> 46:46.094
and was banned from the boxing association
when he disappeared.

46:49.598 --> 46:50.474
Put a wanted alert.

46:51.433 --> 46:52.518
Yes, sir. We will.

46:52.601 --> 46:56.647
That was the most…
entertaining match so far.

46:57.147 --> 47:01.276
The interesting thing is your fan base
is usually most excited

47:01.360 --> 47:05.072
about the kind of fouls
that you don't see in mainstream fights,

47:05.155 --> 47:07.533
but yesterday it wasn't the case.

47:08.033 --> 47:11.161
Baek-jeong, you beautiful,
dirty son of a bitch,

47:11.245 --> 47:14.998
when you fouled against Gun-woo,
the audience was up in arms.

47:15.082 --> 47:16.250
I think we've found

47:16.333 --> 47:19.294
the ultimate protagonist
that everyone wants to cheer for.

47:19.378 --> 47:23.048
So I've decided to buy the IKFC

47:23.715 --> 47:26.051
for $400 million.

47:26.134 --> 47:28.470
51% shares, exactly.

47:28.971 --> 47:30.889
However, I have two conditions.

47:30.973 --> 47:37.020
First, a contract signed by Gun-woo to
fight three years exclusively in the IKFC.

47:37.104 --> 47:40.816
Number two, you will lose to Gun-woo
in the next fight.

47:40.899 --> 47:44.027
The IKFC doesn't need two shining stars.

47:44.111 --> 47:47.865
Gun-woo's gonna be our new mascot,
and eventually, the face of the IKFC.

47:47.948 --> 47:50.659
That means, Baek-jeong,
you're gonna have to step down.

47:54.246 --> 47:56.915
Are you fucking kidding me?
This is my world.

47:56.999 --> 47:59.167
I created the IKFC.

47:59.960 --> 48:06.717
And that's why I'm paying you
and buying 51% of the shares.

48:06.800 --> 48:08.010
I don't like it.

48:08.510 --> 48:09.595
And one more thing.

48:10.387 --> 48:11.221
What?

48:11.847 --> 48:13.015
If I see you,

48:14.474 --> 48:15.309
I'll kill you.

48:15.392 --> 48:16.435
Go fuck yourself.

48:16.518 --> 48:19.062
Yeah, fuck you, too, you fucking bastard!

48:21.565 --> 48:25.736
What are you doing? He offered us
$400 million! This is what we want!

48:25.819 --> 48:26.987
Ah!

48:30.157 --> 48:31.658
Fucking asshole.

48:32.492 --> 48:35.495
I'll do this my way. You stupid fuck.

48:37.289 --> 48:40.208
You run your fucking mouth again
and you die, all right?

48:40.292 --> 48:41.376
Okay. Yes, sir!

48:57.935 --> 48:59.144
President Im.

49:02.230 --> 49:05.901
The police have issued
a wanted alert for you.

49:06.693 --> 49:07.569
What?

49:08.695 --> 49:09.738
How'd that happen?

49:09.821 --> 49:13.408
You'll need to leave.
You've got to get out of Korea.

49:14.409 --> 49:16.954
I can arrange it. A jet just for you.

49:18.538 --> 49:22.042
Oh, shit's fucking…

49:25.420 --> 49:27.589
-Get me Gun-woo's mom
-What?

49:28.173 --> 49:30.759
If I have her,
that asshole will listen and follow!

49:32.594 --> 49:34.179
This time, it'll be to the death.

49:34.680 --> 49:36.515
'Cause only one of us is going down.

49:37.808 --> 49:39.518
Those fucking bastards!

49:39.601 --> 49:41.979
I'll show them who the real deal is.

49:42.479 --> 49:44.398
I'll turn it all upside down.
